#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Our services"
msgstr "Unsere Leistungen"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Comprehensive care for your pets"
msgstr "Umfassende Pflege für Ihre Haustiere"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Dogs, cats and small mammals — comprehensive veterinary care in one place, with technology at a very high level. Our goal is to provide the widest possible range of care under one roof."
msgstr "Hunde, Katzen und Kleinsäuger — umfassende tierärztliche Versorgung an einem Ort, mit Technik auf sehr hohem Niveau. Unser Ziel ist es, ein möglichst breites Leistungsspektrum unter einem Dach anzubieten."

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "<span>Dogs</span>"
msgstr "<span>Hunde</span>"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "<span>Cats</span>"
msgstr "<span>Katzen</span>"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "<span>Small mammals</span>"
msgstr "<span>Kleinsäuger</span>"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Preventive care"
msgstr "Präventivpflege"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Regular check-ups, vaccinations and deworming. Prevention is the foundation of your pet's health."
msgstr "Regelmäßige Untersuchungen, Impfungen und Entwurmung. Vorsorge ist die Grundlage der Gesundheit Ihres Tieres."

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Surgery"
msgstr "Chirurgie"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Neutering and abdominal procedures. A modern operating theatre with anaesthesia monitoring."
msgstr "Kastrationen und abdominale Eingriffe. Moderner Operationssaal mit Anästhesie-Monitoring."

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Internal medicine"
msgstr "Innere Medizin"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Diagnosis and treatment of internal diseases, cardiology, endocrinology and gastroenterology."
msgstr "Diagnose und Behandlung innerer Erkrankungen, Kardiologie, Endokrinologie und Gastroenterologie."

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostik"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "RTG, ultrasound, laboratory blood and urine tests. Fast and accurate diagnostics for proper treatment.​"
msgstr "Röntgen, Ultraschall, Labortests von Blut und Urin. Schnelle und genaue Diagnostik für die richtige Behandlung.​"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Dentistry"
msgstr "Zahnheilkunde"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Dental treatment, extractions, ultrasonic cleaning. Oral care for your pet's healthy teeth."
msgstr "Zahnbehandlung, Extraktionen, Ultraschallreinigung. Mundpflege für gesunde Zähne Ihres Tieres."

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Ophthalmology"
msgstr "Ophthalmologie"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Examination and treatment of eye diseases in small animals, including diagnostics and surgical procedures."
msgstr "Untersuchung und Behandlung von Augenerkrankungen bei Kleintieren, einschließlich Diagnostik und chirurgischer Eingriffe."

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Dermatology"
msgstr "Dermatologie"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Treatment of skin problems, allergies and parasitic diseases. Comprehensive care for skin and coat."
msgstr "Behandlung von Hautproblemen, Allergien und Parasitenerkrankungen. Umfassende Pflege von Haut und Fell."

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "Ultrasonography"
msgstr "Ultraschall"

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
msgid "We have doctors specialising in ultrasound diagnostics. We are developing this area further, including towards cardiology examinations."
msgstr "Wir haben Ärzte mit Spezialisierung auf Ultraschalldiagnostik. Diesen Bereich bauen wir weiter aus, auch in Richtung kardiologischer Untersuchungen."

#. module: elite_vet_theme
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:elite_vet_theme.s_vet_sluzby
